  * Fix Meshtastic interpolator bandwidth update #2917
  * Python Example: Update Python 2 syntax in Swagger example.
  * map/webserver : Fix WebServer substitution memory leak. #2923
  * objectpipesregistrations: Fix ObjectPipesRegistrations memory
    leak #2924
  * device/deviceuiset: Fix GLSpectrumView use-after-free. #2925
  * map/mapgui: Fix MapGUI memory leaks on exit #2926
  * mapmodel: Fix MapModel and ObjectMapItem memory leaks #2927
  * map/mapsettings: Fix MapSettings item settings ownership #2928
  * resolve uninitialized member variables in the plugins dir #2930
  * Position fallback options when GPS is unavailable #2932
  * Serialize configuration loads to fix a use-after-free #2948
  * wavfilerecord: add RF64 support #2951
  * meshtastic: retain upchirp FFT bin residuals #2952
  * Add MCP Server for Claude & ChatGPT  #2934
  * tree wide: Fix message ownership and reporting for unhandled
    queue messages #2955
  * fix: range rate assignment in satellite tracker for sgp4 #2956
  * Add NVIDIA Denoiser and VST3 effects to Denoiser Feature #2958
  * Add button to display connections between devices, channels
    and features.
  * BFMDemod: Set audio icon background to green when squelch open
  * RadioClock: Add support for RBU and PCSK-225.
  * FileSink: Fix waterfall resetting #2965
  * codacy: Add PR review instructions by @rgetz in #2974
  * Add PSK31 Demod #2966
  * Add WEFAX demodulator #2975
  * DSC: Add support for VHF. Improve HF performance. #2976
  * PlutoSDR: fix four crashes with Rx + Tx device sets on one
    device (#2721).
  * Pager: Add FLEX support. by @srcejon in #2978
  * Try #2 in codacy ai reviewer by @rgetz in #2980
  * Fix remaining uninitialized member variables and unset variable
    warnings #2984
  * Packet Demod: add native G3RUH 9600 receive mode.
  * Add Broadcast FM modulator.
  * WDSP Rx: fill WDSPRxReport instead of null SSBDemodReport in
    channel report.
  * Prevent unsafe copying of resource-owning classes #2996
  * meshtasticdemod: add carrier frequency offset to JSON output.
  * ValueDial: fix out of range read in paintEvent while animating
    #3001
  * MeshCore demod: connect preset combo and Apply button #3002
  * Add DVB demodulator.
  * Presets/Configurations dialogs: remember collapsed groups #3004
  * Add trailing-whitespace checks to GitHub Actions and provide an
