Wed Sep  2 10:56:29 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 7.72.2
  * Improve PlutoSDR discovery robustness and identitection mgr.
  * Fix WebAPI link in About dialog (Display 127.0.0.1 rather than
    0.0.0.0).
