    than getAirspyHfReport. #2810
  * Fix kiwiSDRs on Map.
  * PlutoSDR: Guard against null buddy shared pointers.
  * WDSP: Fix distorted AM audio when AGC is disabled.
  * plutosdr: Update RX gain limits dynamically from hardware.
  * AM Demod: Snap to nearest centre frequency.
  * Fix Coverity UNINIT warnings in RadioAstronomy and VOR
    Localizer.
  * APRS: Fix memory leak.
  * Fix missing YAML-to-SWG mappings for MeshCore plugins.
  * Fix built-in device selection regression. #2824
  * Improve RadioAstronomyGUI robustnes.
  * Fix -DWITH_STACK_PROTECTOR=PFF typo.
  * PlutoSDR: keep device open state consistent after close.
  * wdsp: Prevent potential out-of-bounds array access. #2843
  * testmi: Fix missing m_title copy in TestMISettings.
  * Fix UDP port validation boolean operations.
  * Fix Astronomy::azAltToXY85 when azimuth or elevation is 0.
  * GLScope: Fix missing freerun setting copy in assignment
    operator.
  * ADSB Demod: Fix incorrect iterator range when restoring column
    sizes.
  * continue to reduce (eliminate) VLA usage from leansdr.
  * chirpchat: Fix FT8 message type 0.4 reply detection.
  * ft8: Fix CRC message length type causing memcpy overflow
    warning.
  * appbench, appsrv: Fix malformed
    QCoreApplication::applicationVersion().
  * ADS-B Demod: Support OpenSky authentication and decoder fixes.
  * AIS, Packet and Pager demodulator improvements.
  * Fix QT_NMEA_SERIAL_PORT on Qt 6.
  * Fix resource ownership and cleanup issues across several
    SDRangel components. #2880
  * afc: fix iterator invalidation when removing channels.
  * channel: fix bandwidth index validation.
  * sdrbench: fix RRC and FFT test file handling.

