Thu Apr  8 18:58:42 UTC 2021 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 6.8.0
  * Packet Error Tester feature plugin
    This plugin can be used to measure the packet error rate over
    digital, packet based protcols such as AX.25
    (Packet mod/demod), LoRa (ChipChat mod/demod) and 802.15.4.
  * DVB-S2 support in DATV modulator
    brings DVB-S2 support for the modulator. DVB-S2 is increasingly
    popular over DVB-S and the standard on QO-100 wideband transponder.
  Other changes and fixes
  * DATV demodulator: various fixes mostly in the internal player.
    The plugin is not 100% stable but these changes improve it
    significantly.
  * "My position" setting: fixed station position altitude setting.
  * APRS feature: choose between metric and imperial units.
  * AudioOutput plugin: fixed REST API device settings PUT. PATCH.

